### 请假查询CH04-A1 账号A：看本人的两条演示单
GET {{baseUrl}}/leave/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}

### 请假查询CH04-A2 账号B：看本人的一条演示单
GET {{baseUrl}}/leave/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}

### 请假查询CH04-A3 HR：看A和B的三条演示单
GET {{baseUrl}}/leave/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}

### CH04-B1 先看已有记录，记住基线
GET {{baseUrl}}/leave/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}

### CH04-B2 创建待确认摘要
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"年假 2026-10-12 09:00 到 2026-10-12 18:00 原因：个人安排"}

> {%
client.global.set("ch04Session", response.body.session_id);
%}

### CH04-B3 在同一会话确认
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"确认","session_id":"{{ch04Session}}"}

> {%
client.global.set("ch04LeaveId", response.body.leave_id);
%}

### CH04-B4 查看刚刚生成的单号
GET {{baseUrl}}/leave/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}

### CH04-C1 HR批准B3创建的申请
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/{{ch04LeaveId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"同意"}

### CH04-C2 新建事假待办
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"事假 2026-10-13 09:00 到 2026-10-13 18:00 原因：家庭事务"}

> {%
client.global.set("ch04RejectSession", response.body.session_id);
%}

### CH04-C3 确认第二张新申请
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"确认","session_id":"{{ch04RejectSession}}"}

> {%
client.global.set("ch04RejectId", response.body.leave_id);
%}

### CH04-C4 HR驳回
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/{{ch04RejectId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"请调整日期"}

### CH04-C5 新建待办
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"年假 2026-10-14 09:00 到 2026-10-14 18:00 原因：个人安排"}

> {%
client.global.set("ch04CancelSession", response.body.session_id);
%}

### CH04-C6 确认第三张新申请
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"确认","session_id":"{{ch04CancelSession}}"}

> {%
client.global.set("ch04CancelId", response.body.leave_id);
%}

### CH04-C7 本人撤销
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/{{ch04CancelId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}

### ================= 路径一：申请 -> 确认 -> HR驳回 =================

### CH04-T1 新建事假待办
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"事假 2026-10-13 09:00 到 2026-10-13 18:00 原因：家庭事务"}

> {%
    client.global.set("ch04RejectSession", response.body.session_id);
%}

### CH04-T2 确认新申请
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"确认","session_id":"{{ch04RejectSession}}"}

> {%
    client.global.set("ch04RejectId", response.body.leave_id);
%}

### CH04-T3 HR驳回
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/{{ch04RejectId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"请调整日期"}


### ================= 路径二：申请 -> 确认 -> 本人撤销 =================

### CH04-T4 新建年假待办
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"年假 2026-10-14 09:00 到 2026-10-14 18:00 原因：个人安排"}

> {%
    client.global.set("ch04CancelSession", response.body.session_id);
%}

### CH04-T5 确认新申请
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"确认","session_id":"{{ch04CancelSession}}"}

> {%
    client.global.set("ch04CancelId", response.body.leave_id);
%}

### CH04-T6 本人撤销
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/{{ch04CancelId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### ================= 路径三：申请 -> 确认 -> HR批准 (补充的完整闭环) =================

### CH04-T7 新建病假待办
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"病假 2026-10-15 09:00 到 2026-10-15 18:00 原因：身体不适"}

> {%
    client.global.set("ch04ApproveSession", response.body.session_id);
%}

### CH04-T8 确认新申请
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"确认","session_id":"{{ch04ApproveSession}}"}

> {%
    client.global.set("ch04ApproveId", response.body.leave_id);
%}

### CH04-T9 HR批准
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/{{ch04ApproveId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"同意休假，注意身体"}


### ================= 1. 验证：摘要提示格式问题 =================
# 故意不写原因，或者时间格式不全，触发 missing_fields 校验
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"事假 2026-10-13 09:00 原因：格式测试"}

> {%
    // 预期：响应中 retrieval_status 应为 "missing_fields"
    client.global.set("formatTestSession", response.body.session_id);
%}


### ================= 2. 验证：确认说没有待办 =================
# 故意使用一个错误的 session_id 进行确认
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"确认", "session_id":"invalid-session-id-12345"}

> {%
    // 预期：响应中 retrieval_status 应为 "no_pending_leave"
%}


### ================= 3. 验证：Session 返回 409 =================
# 先正常发起一个申请
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"年假 2026-10-14 09:00 到 2026-10-14 18:00 原因：休息"}

> {%
    client.global.set("session409Test", response.body.session_id);
%}

### 确认它，使其变成真正的请假单（此时 Session 应该失效或被清理）
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"确认", "session_id":"{{session409Test}}"}

> {%
    client.global.set("leaveId409Test", response.body.leave_id);
%}

### 再次用同一个 session_id 确认，触发 Session 409 冲突
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"确认", "session_id":"{{session409Test}}"}

> {%
    // 预期：响应中 retrieval_status 应为 "leave_already_created" 或类似冲突状态
%}


### ================= 4. 验证：批准或撤销返回 409 =================
# 正常申请并确认一张新单子
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"病假 2026-10-15 09:00 到 2026-10-15 18:00 原因：看病"}

> {%
    client.global.set("session409Approve", response.body.session_id);
%}

### 确认它
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"确认", "session_id":"{{session409Approve}}"}

> {%
    client.global.set("leaveId409Approve", response.body.leave_id);
%}

### HR 批准它
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/{{leaveId409Approve}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"同意"}

### 再次尝试批准（状态已不是 PENDING），预期返回 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/{{leaveId409Approve}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"重复批准测试"}

> {%
    // 预期：HTTP 409 Conflict
%}

### 尝试撤销已经批准的单据，预期返回 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave/{{leaveId409Approve}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

> {%
    // 预期：HTTP 409 Conflict
%}


